{"id":17926,"name":"Elmore County","slug":"elmore-county","state":"Alabama","code":"AL","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-lien/tax-lien-states/alabama-tax-lien-sales-how-to-get-12-interest/elmore-county/","lastUpdated":"2026-07-13T12:29:22","facts":{"taxSaleType":"Tax Lien Sale","typicalSaleDate":"April","bidProcedure":"Bid down","redemptionPeriod":"3 years","interestRate":"Up to 12%","extra":[{"label":"Sale Contact","value":"Citizen Access Portal"},{"label":"Auction Site","value":"GovEase"},{"label":"County Website","value":"Elmore County"}]},"bodyHtml":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed aligncenter is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"D0rgZRzd\"><iframe title=\"Proven Venue Up to 12% Yearly Returns - Elmore County - Alabama Tax Lien Investing\" width=\"1170\" height=\"658\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/FzZ7FrM_cA8?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"A-Proven-Venue-for-Up-to-12%-Yearly-Returns---Elmore-County,-Alabama-Tax-Lien-Investing\">A Proven Venue for Up to 12% Yearly Returns &#8211; Elmore County, Alabama Tax Lien Investing</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Elmore County, Alabama, is making waves in the tax lien investing world by moving its sales online. Investors can earn up to 12% interest. This article will walk you through the process and benefits of participating in Elmore County&#8217;s tax lien sales.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Investing in tax liens can offer high returns compared to traditional investments. With a low entry cost, you can acquire property liens that yield interest or potentially lead to property ownership if the taxes remain unpaid. Elmore County&#8217;s move to online sales enhances both convenience and profitability for investors.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Understanding Tax Lien Certificates</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Tax lien certificates represent a claim against a property for unpaid taxes. When you purchase a tax lien, you pay the owed taxes on behalf of the property owner. In return, you receive a certificate that accrues interest until the owner redeems the lien or you foreclose on the property.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Example:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Year 1:</strong> Purchase a lien for $1,000 at 12% interest.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Return:</strong> $1,120 if redeemed after one year.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Multiple Years:</strong> Interest continues to accrue annually at the same rate.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>If the owner doesn&#8217;t redeem the lien, you might eventually own the property, often at a fraction of its market value.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Steps to Start Tax Lien Investing in Elmore County</h3>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Research and Understand Local Laws</strong><br><br>Familiarize yourself with Alabama&#8217;s legal framework for tax lien sales.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Visit the Local Treasurer&#8217;s Website</strong><br><br>Elmore County Revenue Commissioner: <a href=\"https://elmorerevenuecommissioner.net/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Elmore Revenue Commissioner</mark></a><br><br>Detailed tax sale information: <a href=\"https://elmorerevenuecommissioner.net/Forms/DELQTAXSALE.PDF\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Tax Sale Information</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Check the Auction Site</strong><br><br>Elmore County conducts online auctions via GovEase: <a href=\"http://www.govease.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">GovEase Auction</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Read the Details about Tax Liens</strong><br><br>Understand the auction schedule, parcel information, and other essential details.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Contact the County Office</strong><br><br>For additional inquiries, reach out to the Elmore County Revenue Commissioner: <a href=\"https://www.elmoreco.org/revenue\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Contact Information</mark></a></li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Elmore-County-Courthouse.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Elmore-County-Courthouse-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Elmore-County-Courthouse-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Elmore-County-Courthouse-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Elmore-County-Courthouse-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Elmore-County-Courthouse-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100v